.TH "PERCH-OUTBOUND" "1" "" "perch" "perch manual"
.SH NAME
perch\-outbound \- list submitted messages and delivery status
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perch outbound [OPTIONS] COMMAND
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Inspect the outbound table populated by the submission relay. It shows acceptance and later delivery attempts reported by mxRaven.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
show help
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
list submitted messages
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
perch outbound list \-\-account you@example.com
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBperch\fR(1), \fBperch\-outbound\-list\fR(1)
